{
 "$description": "Snapshot of the LIVE SAMAVESH Figma library's variable names per collection, read 2026-08-10 via use_figma. Used by build/formats/figma-variables.mjs to mark each generated variable as new|existing, so an import is reviewable as a delta. Refresh it by re-reading the file; a stale snapshot only mislabels status, it never changes values.",
 "$readAt": "2026-08-10",
 "$note": "2026-08-10, second pass. Theme: 27 in-place renames so Figma matches the shipped grammar (prominence /Default -> /Base, Text/Link/Default -> Text/Link/Brand); variable ids preserved, so bindings followed. Motion: easing-in-out -> easing-inOut. Color 149 -> 141: retired 8 leftovers that three independent traversals agreed were unbound (Info Transparent x6, Overlay/Scrim, Text/Info); Text/Secondary was NOT retired because it is bound on 12 nodes. Spacing 15 -> 49 and Typography 79 -> 106, created from the code payload. The 24 Color and 2 Typography names listed beyond the payload are Figma-native primitives designers bind to directly (Text/Dark alone has 1,143 bindings) and are deliberately not emitted by the exporter. The 5 type/*-weight variables the code emits are absent from Figma on purpose: Figma models font weight as a STRING style name, the code as a numeric FLOAT, and Figma rejects an alias across resolved types.",
